ext-blue-600 transition-transform duration-300 transform -translate-y-4 bg-white rounded-full group-hover:translate-y-0\">View Details</button></div></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h4 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Local Business SEO</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Improved local search rankings for a small business, increasing foot traffic.</p></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg group bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl hover:-translate-y-2\"><div class=\"relative h-64 overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Product Descriptions\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/placeholder.svg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-0 bg-blue-600/80 group-hover:opacity-100\"><button class=\"px-6 py-2 font-medium text-blue-600 transition-transform duration-300 transform -translate-y-4 bg-white rounded-full group-hover:translate-y-0\">View Details</button></div></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h4 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Product Descriptions</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Crafted compelling product descriptions that increased conversion rates.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"testimonials\" class=\"py-16 text-white bg-gray-900 section\"><div class=\"container px-4 mx-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 text-center\"><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-blue-400\">Testimonials</h2><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl\">What Clients Say</h3></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 mb-12 md:gap-16\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mr-2 text-yellow-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M11.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.519 4.674a1 1 0 00.95.69h4.915c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-3.976 2.888a1 1 0 00-.363 1.118l1.518 4.674c.3.922-.755 1.688-1.538 1.118l-3.976-2.888a1 1 0 00-1.176 0l-3.976 2.888c-.783.57-1.838-.197-1.538-1.118l1.518-4.674a1 1 0 00-.363-1.118l-3.976-2.888c-.784-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h4.914a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.519-4.674z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-bold\">10+ Years Experience</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mr-2 text-green-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-bold\">100+ Projects Completed</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mr-2 text-blue-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-bold\">50+ Happy Clients</span></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 py-8 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing\" style=\"scroll-behavior:smooth;direction:ltr;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;-ms-overflow-style:none;scrollbar-width:none\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-full max-w-md p-6 bg-gray-800 shadow-lg rounded-xl\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"relative w-16 h-16\"><img alt=\"Sarah Johnson\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover border-2 border-blue-400 rounded-full\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/placeholder.svg\"/></div><div><h4 class=